.TH postar-init 1  "init " 
.SH NAME
postar\-init \- Intializes the configuration files
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpostar init\fR [\fB\-\-custom\-path\fR] [\fB\-\-write\-example\-rules\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Intializes the configuration files
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-custom\-path\fR \fI<CUSTOM_PATH>\fR
Custom output path for the config file

By default we write the configuration file to the default path depending on your OS.
.TP
\fB\-\-write\-example\-rules\fR
Whether to write a sample rules.ptar file to the default path
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
